            <div xml:id="m-ddd827de-2bbc-49dc-9c68-29135b9d0024">
              <lg xml:id="m-c0de13fa-4c13-4e4f-a516-7bbf62bb51cc">
                <l xml:id="m-cad3794e-ff5e-48a5-b34f-17d35bf3e7af" facs="#m-2b75cfd3-03c6-4f77-8f80-c63d59e62d43" label="text-like">The Paschal Vigil</l><l xml:id="m-d513bce8-7653-4eae-97ff-82566c6c4c94" facs="#m-c5e0c476-de99-453b-ad4e-5f922ba2498a" label="ambiguous">77er</l><l xml:id="m-642d5744-9868-473d-abc1-fa280e5e9028" facs="#m-c8517b8b-bde7-42bf-a2a4-0375e09c8cf5" label="lyrics-like">cúrruum, ferebantúrque in pro¬ exércitus Pharaónis, qui sequén¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2f01633-ddc4-4001-bc6f-9bf2e4e84f5c" facs="#m-320a1dd4-c8ce-4e21-8727-00125139632d" label="lyrics-like">fúndum. Dixérunt ergo Æ</l><l xml:id="m-e5fe0586-9c68-479a-a629-25996dbafbba" facs="#m-602b0267-b2e5-4190-831f-5d2507b37a47" label="lyrics-like">tes ingréssi fúerant mare: nec</l><l xml:id="m-06636a53-44c8-433f-9918-bba8834f170d" facs="#m-1e8d1b0f-3e24-4d18-a74e-a6f4fead1d07" label="lyrics-like">ptii : « Fugiámus Israélem:</l><l xml:id="m-fc0576f9-7b4d-4549-ae4e-d77429359727" facs="#m-596365fd-d1ec-4461-ac20-4040d0177979" label="lyrics-like">unus quidem supérfuit ex eis.</l><l xml:id="m-f64d02e7-271f-4d7f-969e-21f781569338" facs="#m-2063bc55-8808-4ca0-b6ab-7a610a55b734" label="lyrics-like">Filii autem Israël perrexérunt</l><l xml:id="m-76fc76e9-c8b0-4598-861f-fa0514b5107a" facs="#m-34a10f15-ee05-4e84-936d-3643f71957d9" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus enim pugnat pro eis</l><l xml:id="m-0e0495f7-43b0-49d6-b2e3-24ef1d82eb6d" facs="#m-44fd4feb-9f73-4b44-af71-baadb8b910d6" label="lyrics-like">per médium sicci maris, et aquae</l><l xml:id="m-d30a9d53-a55e-4959-8403-99417abd7a24" facs="#m-120f13b1-8da3-4d92-9fb9-de1b1c868b95" label="lyrics-like">contra nos ». Et ait Dóminus ad</l><l xml:id="m-353b4c84-ee17-4447-8e0e-a59a7f26236c" facs="#m-ce3aab4c-76f0-4b63-a602-8bec268ff822" label="ambiguous">eis erant quasi pro muro a dex¬</l><l xml:id="m-e355fe59-2b99-4fe8-bf3a-b3d30b08e62e" facs="#m-faf6bfd8-5cfa-474e-97f9-c4440d4aa29b" label="lyrics-like">Móysen: « Exténde manum</l><l xml:id="m-f08fcaa3-5bf7-4d89-8c50-c8710302e146" facs="#m-9abaa713-1b46-4f2e-ac08-087a838e10b6" label="ambiguous">tris et a sinistris: liberavitque</l><l xml:id="m-88dde7fa-e871-4a56-88b4-f6c55a9cd627" facs="#m-2ee569a3-8879-4fe8-9645-5a8868aaf53a" label="lyrics-like">tuam super mare, ut revertántur</l><l xml:id="m-3f10c65e-22d3-417a-bd4b-a519d6f3209e" facs="#m-7aaba62a-a80c-4879-ba25-7ff323e881f6" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus in die illa Israël de</l><l xml:id="m-ce0fd9ab-3611-4bc5-9c5b-f5a1fb4255c7" facs="#m-486b7463-f384-489f-87a1-363c243d62f6" label="ambiguous">aquae ad Ægyptios super currus,</l><l xml:id="m-7d937bdb-8dff-41fd-ae20-04a35c8b0093" facs="#m-b4e6be86-8f7b-43f3-ab7f-b85e7afc2079" label="lyrics-like">manu Ægyptiórum. Et vidérunt</l><l xml:id="m-99521747-39eb-402d-b8be-0fe52698112c" facs="#m-d309560b-bb76-419c-883d-30cfed7caa4c" label="lyrics-like">et équites eórum ». Cumque</l><l xml:id="m-1e2a36d6-c72a-43f0-bad7-0363817490b3" facs="#m-7c467294-a408-4726-a20f-1a01a2252d4e" label="lyrics-like">Ægyptios mórtuos super littus</l><l xml:id="m-185efca1-07e1-47e4-9abf-2f5e578b2da4" facs="#m-72d6979a-ffc3-4b90-bb4a-8c86a26a92d0" label="lyrics-like">extendisset Móyses manum con¬</l><l xml:id="m-a47bdb51-0f24-4120-80ed-43d0e13e04dc" facs="#m-f1d5910e-9783-43e9-8727-3ebd45cfae90" label="ambiguous">maris, et manum magnam,</l><l xml:id="m-d372be01-c579-4c43-bde0-2fcc273e2fb0" facs="#m-f2cdfa7a-d76b-43e0-a602-4beef6be62bd" label="lyrics-like">tra mare, revérsum est primo</l><l xml:id="m-83c85065-4c8b-4e2b-8ef0-2b21e9c415f6" facs="#m-0a6bde77-4eee-4cb3-a857-246a85ca2cb2" label="lyrics-like">quam exercúerat Dóminus con¬</l><l xml:id="m-9ffa6e82-8ab6-4c5a-aa27-943e14a382a8" facs="#m-e12cbcb3-4b56-407e-84a1-1b605998f288" label="lyrics-like">dilúculo ad priórem locum</l><l xml:id="m-56d9d82b-328f-43ee-a267-537c11bf74ab" facs="#m-9d32ed2a-5e79-4488-b923-4a6e3f0d5cdc" label="lyrics-like">tra cos: timuitque pópulus</l><l xml:id="m-fe283c65-ac46-4966-b781-938376ee4af5" facs="#m-293b8a62-7f4e-4f80-b78d-743ede560179" label="lyrics-like">fugientibúsque Ægyptiis occur¬</l><l xml:id="m-4d6a695b-d777-488d-8d68-c86118db5e36" facs="#m-7dfaa38c-c012-4381-ae35-804952dbf43f" label="lyrics-like">Dóminum, et credidérunt Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-67ab8436-7c3f-4169-8c14-a9e166780c7f" facs="#m-79ba9275-0239-46af-9e0a-0bb6764eea42" label="lyrics-like">rérunt aquae, et invólvit eos</l><l xml:id="m-eea80584-c2df-4259-80c2-08606d1acc1a" facs="#m-8fd9baea-3be9-4a40-8e42-61fdd2a870dd" label="lyrics-like">mino, et Móysi servo ejus. Tunc</l><l xml:id="m-a92813be-b37e-4b91-8069-e53fa38f0980" facs="#m-b4bb8d57-21fe-4815-8bdf-37081e53e8b8" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus in médiis nuctibus.</l><l xml:id="m-6aa297b5-0d7a-4aea-a9b1-8d530f0927fd" facs="#m-b57b0cdd-8976-466b-adee-7fb318285753" label="lyrics-like">cécinit Móyses, et fllii Israël, car¬</l><l xml:id="m-2761a2ac-12e9-42d7-95ce-91de90af73fb" facs="#m-b7eb9b2f-9d49-44aa-83f1-6adb1a283f39" label="lyrics-like">Reversaéque sunt aquae, et ope¬</l><l xml:id="m-355a9cb8-3654-412b-b556-06bfc832476a" facs="#m-7b848b33-8ef3-4e63-b2ac-d9cf728011fa" label="lyrics-like">ruérunt currus et équites cuncti! men hoc Dómino, et dixérunt:</l><l xml:id="m-5451d280-5368-452b-9314-f99cb39c3d63" facs="#m-674b91d1-877a-4b88-8f42-30d6bb878d2c" label="ambiguous">canticle</l><l xml:id="m-258c47a4-192e-4cc3-85ed-ff3bc6f6473d" facs="#m-11e62adf-382a-48ff-a495-30ac20cd9656" label="text-like">Ex. 15, 1 and 2</l><l xml:id="m-6a7b7f2c-b9d6-4ea7-92d3-1ba7e5708cff" facs="#m-50416092-832d-4730-a262-632fd70dbbfe" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-c67c7ce1-8f0a-46b8-8aec-dd1952c65d71" facs="#m-0b1d8a65-624c-4150-bd64-332f63d20095" label="ambiguous">C</l><l xml:id="m-3226500b-dff5-41bc-8819-402eb827b21b" facs="#m-cd2fcfc3-05c9-4974-8a91-e123b83c606b" label="lyrics-like">"Dómi-no:</l><l xml:id="m-f414e4f0-b9e4-42ce-a584-c9171555061b" facs="#m-f6b23877-26af-48f0-8d64-f845acd7189f" label="lyrics-like">glo-ri-6́-se e- nim</l><l xml:id="m-2618bc8f-426d-440b-8b81-8a4cb24441ad" facs="#m-11efdf9e-8b93-458c-9071-0243cb35f809" label="lyrics-like">Anté-mus</l><l xml:id="m-95c3201b-cf71-411b-a89e-9f3277a3d217" facs="#m-5d27e0fb-9513-4cc6-9889-b5ddbabd8d7a" label="lyrics-like">hono-ri-fi- cá- tus est : équum et ascen-só¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd2461f3-9797-4bb6-8702-4b29e4c91ffe" facs="#m-00b0d117-0d06-468c-9889-88827ee99225" label="lyrics-like">adjú-tor</l><l xml:id="m-47dcf50a-40ef-4fd7-bcc5-4befd2a799d7" facs="#m-80f39d8d-a251-4e34-b266-4eadf1f2ded5" label="lyrics-like">pro-jé-cit in má¬ re:</l><l xml:id="m-dfe99fd3-a485-43cb-bb1f-b4173783b7bb" facs="#m-26725999-14dd-4a08-bfac-44ac618414e4" label="ambiguous">rem</l><l xml:id="m-38e60709-0c5f-4a03-8f1f-3d49c0a9e165" facs="#m-57db571a-784e-490b-bdf7-c7f5d1730c13" label="lyrics-like">et pro-téctor fáctus est mi-hi in sa¬ lú-tem.</l><l xml:id="m-fe34897e-970a-4c92-adc9-9f89cd6b314f" facs="#m-f423faa5-21c9-4e7f-bff2-7eaa576b7e42" label="lyrics-like">V. Hic Dé-us mé-us,</l><l xml:id="m-f2bdd66c-875f-4cab-af67-8901fc184486" facs="#m-b5e7ca41-0836-4381-a287-303d31797e12" label="lyrics-like">et honorábo é¬</l><l xml:id="m-a98dbca1-6a8c-4de4-8a1c-212e67a09fec" facs="#m-c8190685-6913-4e5b-a697-9817124fd4f9" label="ambiguous">um:</l><l xml:id="m-8f0273b0-9276-403d-ba70-6ab2fb6b661e" facs="#m-5e9d3895-3542-45b4-837b-84db93d7d6dd" label="ambiguous">i</l><l xml:id="m-57d2b1e1-9603-4311-bda0-c23f67a08624" facs="#m-bb814dc0-3775-4d67-8721-bc40ea6e73e4" label="lyrics-like">Dé-us pátris mé¬</l><l xml:id="m-6aab78cc-462d-4b99-b44c-2eb2cdd6e1fb" facs="#m-3178cc04-12fe-442f-a7b6-7c4f0f8a60c7" label="lyrics-like">é¬</l><l xml:id="m-efb19ce5-d6a0-49aa-85d1-cfefea5afa6d" facs="#m-b624208a-144f-4751-bc37-f26afdb5bbcd" label="lyrics-like">et exal- tá- bo</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>